# Kaggle API Credentials
# =======================
# Instructions:
# 1. Go to https://www.kaggle.com/account
# 2. Scroll to "API" section
# 3. Click "Create New API Token"
# 4. Download kaggle.json file
# 5. Copy username and key values below

KAGGLE_USERNAME=your_kaggle_username_here
KAGGLE_KEY=your_kaggle_api_key_here

# AWS Lambda Configuration
# ========================
# These are configured in AWS Lambda Console:
# Lambda Function → Configuration → Environment variables
# 
# Note: AWS credentials are NOT needed as environment variables
# Lambda uses IAM execution role for AWS service permissions

# DO NOT commit this file with real values!
# This is a template file only.



#`.env` is **blocked** in `.gitignore` file!

---

## **CHECK `.gitignore` file:**

